format 1

# Seeded by `pklith seed --init` from the fragments this repository's
# files switch on (`pklith detect`). It is yours now: pklith never rewrites it.
#
# No built-in check reads these types yet, so `pklith check` names them
# until each gets checks or an exempt reason: envrc, format-upstream, gitignore, lock, spec-records.

## checks
id|category|nix|glob|check|fix|env|msg
lychee|lint|lychee|**/*.md|lychee --offline --no-progress {{files}}|-|-|a markdown link points at a file or anchor that does not exist; fix the link (offline: external URLs are not fetched)
gen-check|gate|-|.pklith, hk.pklith.pkl, nix/pklith.nix|pklith gen --check|pklith gen|-|hk.pklith.pkl or nix/pklith.nix no longer matches .pklith; run pklith gen
pklith-check|coverage|-|**/*|pklith check|-|-|a tracked file type has no row in .pklith, a row matches nothing, or a claimed check never reaches its files

## types
type|checks|min|exempt
*|trailing-whitespace, final-newline, line-endings, no-bom, no-merge-conflict, no-case-conflict, no-broken-symlinks, no-private-key, ripsecrets, typos, editorconfig-checker, no-local-paths, itok, pklith-check|-|-
editorconfig|-|-|written by pklith (seed or gen)
gitattributes|-|-|written by pklith (seed or gen)
md|markdownlint, lychee|-|-
nix|nixfmt, statix, deadnix|-|-
path:**/SPEC.md|markdownlint, mth-fmt, mth-check, sherd-check, sherd-nav, sherd-budget|-|-
path:.context-limits|sherd-budget|-|-
pklith|gen-check|-|-
pkl|-|-|written by pklith (seed or gen)
pre-commit|-|-|written by pklith (seed or gen)
pre-push|-|-|written by pklith (seed or gen)
path:.envrc|-|-|one line `use flake`; direnv evaluates it
path:.gitignore|-|-|ignore patterns, no syntax to check
path:flake.lock|-|-|generated by `nix flake lock`
path:.format-upstream|-|-|vendored record copied from microlith v0.7.4
path:.spec-records|-|-|read by `mth check --records` (spec step)
path:FORMAT.md|-|-|vendored from microlith v0.7.4, unmodified (`.format-upstream`)
path:FORMAT-EXTENSIONS.md|-|-|vendored from microlith v0.7.4, unmodified
path:SPEC-PROMPT.md|-|-|historical input, kept unchanged
path:.markdownlintignore|-|-|ignore list read by markdownlint, no syntax to check
toml|taplo|-|-
yaml|yamllint|-|-
